[hrdoucet@watcgl.waterloo.edu (Heloise Doucet) writes:]
[] OK guys, I have a wand of polymorph and a ring of polymorph control -
[] how do I polypile?

Throop (i think) wrote a treatise here on this subject awhile back.
if you can find that article, read it!  the gist of the matter is to
collect all the junk you've discarded throughout the dungeon (especially
wands since they'll become polywands) and pile the junk into one or
perhaps three adjacent piles.  polyprofessionals sort the piles for
ease of access but that will come in time.  zap the pile(s) and sort
through it/them looking for goodies.  the polymorph spell changes an
object into another object in its class (i.e. a black cap may become
a polished silver shield or a potion of object detection may become
a potion of gain level or gain ability).  it helps if you have a supply
of holy water and also if you can identify things efficiently.

if you get good at this then there's no reason why you can't have
18 or better stats, AC rating below -35, experience level better than
25 and a +8 named weapon and various other toys and trinkets.  the only
drawback ... the game will now be too easy ... :(

